# Node
node_modules/
dist/
# …except the web app's, which `crates/cli` embeds with `rust_embed`.
# `cargo install --git` never runs pnpm, so a binary installed that way embedded
# an empty directory and `site` failed with "embedded web assets are missing" —
# the interactive view existed and could not be shipped. `just web-current`
# keeps the committed build from going stale.
!apps/web/dist/
!apps/web/dist/**
# …except the model a local build copies in: that is the analyzed application's
# own data, never this repository's. `public/model.json` is ignored for the same
# reason, and un-ignoring the whole `dist/` tree would otherwise let it in.
apps/web/dist/model.json

# Rust
target/

# Generated artifacts
apps/web/public/model.json
apps/vscode/out/
apps/vscode/media/
*.vsix
# Copied from the repository root at build time, so there is one source of truth
# for the license text the VSIX ships (see `just ext-build`).
apps/vscode/LICENSE
apps/vscode/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md

# Misc
.DS_Store
*.local
